        try c.Collect(1 ether) { ok = true; } catch { ok = false; }
        (uint unlockTime, uint balance) = c.Acc(actor);
        // In reference, Collect reverts due to block.timestamp > unlockTime being false (unlockTime=0, block.timestamp > 0? but unlockTime was set to block.timestamp during Put, so after warp it's >). Actually: Put with _unlockTime=0 sets acc.unlockTime = block.timestamp (since 0 <= block.timestamp). After warp, block.timestamp > acc.unlockTime, so reference would succeed. Need different: set _unlockTime far in future. Use _unlockTime = block.timestamp + 1000, then warp to block.timestamp+500 (still before unlock), then Collect reverts in reference.
